      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "Present: Mr.Kamal Narula, Advocate, for the petitioners.\n Mr.A.P.S.Tung, Dag, Punjab.\n Mr.Munish Gulati, Advocate, for respondent No.2.\n *******\nDeepak Sibal, J. (Oral)",
