      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "(1) The present petition has been filed under Section 482 Cr.P.C. for quashing of FIR No.122 dated 15.09.2017 registered under Sections 420 and 120-B IPC at Police Station Mamdot, District Ferozepur and all proceedings arising therefrom qua the petitioners on the basis of a compromise dated 21.09.2019 (Annexure P-2) entered into between the parties.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 591,
      "end": 943,
